k of your dial or speedometer report.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/now-intelligence/reporting/c\\_CreateDialsAndSpeedometers.html","release":"australia","product":"Reporting","classification":"reporting","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":10,"breadcrumb":["Report types","Reporting","Reporting","dashboards","and Performance Analytics in the Core UI","Platform Analytics"],"tags":["#now-intelligence","#reports","#builder","#scheduling","#analytics","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/now-intelligence/reporting/c_CreateDialsAndSpeedometers.md"},
